WEBVTT

01:40.810 --> 01:44.210
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.039 --> 01:47.280
[Episode 5]

02:10.030 --> 02:10.830
What are you doing?

02:14.750 --> 02:16.470
I... I'm pulling up the sheet for you.

02:17.350 --> 02:18.350
I don't want you to catch a cold.

02:18.460 --> 02:19.400
Go back to sleep then.

02:20.510 --> 02:21.310
Get out.

02:22.510 --> 02:23.310
Okay.

02:28.550 --> 02:29.350
Close the door.

02:54.390 --> 02:55.340
Last night, extra guards

02:55.340 --> 02:56.390
were deployed to protect Tianqu Peak.

02:56.460 --> 02:57.470
It is said that something went missing.

02:58.190 --> 02:59.710
What a surprise to know someone would actually

03:00.060 --> 03:01.110
covet Dingxu's worthless bottles and pots.

03:01.110 --> 03:01.910
We don't care about those,

03:01.910 --> 03:03.350
but many others do.

03:03.590 --> 03:04.510
Countless people would go to Tianqu Peak

03:04.510 --> 03:05.150
in quest of medicine

03:05.150 --> 03:06.110
every year.

03:06.110 --> 03:06.830
They all want to prolong

03:06.830 --> 03:07.870
their lives or live forever, don't they?

03:08.110 --> 03:10.120
His days are numbered.

03:10.350 --> 03:11.710
How can he assure someone of an immortal life?

03:14.270 --> 03:15.190
We're alone in here.

03:15.190 --> 03:16.590
We don't have to pretend every day, do we?

03:17.470 --> 03:18.790
It's not just about deceit.

03:19.030 --> 03:21.190
There's great wisdom hidden in this.

03:22.310 --> 03:24.950
Keep studying in seclusion till the right moment comes.

03:25.960 --> 03:26.750
I don't understand.

03:28.510 --> 03:29.390
The human race

03:29.670 --> 03:31.110
is not half bad.

03:31.390 --> 03:33.350
If their lifespan were longer

03:33.590 --> 03:34.860
and their strength bigger,

03:34.990 --> 03:36.610
the immortal race would be out of the picture, right?

03:37.230 --> 03:38.470
Are humans really that good?

03:41.110 --> 03:42.510
Don't strain yourself.

03:43.470 --> 03:45.750
It takes intelligence to study this stuff.

03:46.300 --> 03:47.700
You won't be able to figure it out.

03:52.630 --> 03:54.150
What's wrong? Did you not sleep well last night?

03:55.590 --> 03:56.390
I don't know what got into

03:56.390 --> 03:57.270
Tan Jiyin.

03:57.430 --> 03:59.150
She came to my room in the middle of the night.

03:59.390 --> 04:00.710
So I had to stay on guard against her all night.

04:01.230 --> 04:02.070
Then what happened?

04:02.990 --> 04:04.190
She never returned.

04:06.430 --> 04:07.110
You felt a bit

04:07.110 --> 04:08.190
disappointed, didn't you?

04:10.310 --> 04:11.590
If you're really sleepy,

04:11.590 --> 04:12.750
then take a bath and have a nap.

04:12.870 --> 04:13.950
I'm sure you'll sleep better this time.

04:22.630 --> 04:24.250
This tiny lock clasp alone

04:24.430 --> 04:25.550
can't possibly control

04:25.550 --> 04:26.750
the entire golden hoop.

04:27.310 --> 04:28.790
Plus, each lock piece

04:28.830 --> 04:30.270
contains several variations.

04:30.850 --> 04:32.420
How did they get it done?

04:33.140 --> 04:34.270
Did I not get

04:34.350 --> 04:35.750
a good enough look last night

04:36.110 --> 04:37.830
so I missed out some important details?

05:34.110 --> 05:35.270
Ji Tanyin...

05:41.870 --> 05:42.950
Ji Tanyin.

05:43.030 --> 05:44.710
I... I...

05:45.360 --> 05:46.550
I didn't see anything.

06:00.030 --> 06:02.180
Tell me, what exactly do you want?

06:02.990 --> 06:04.350
Nothing.

06:04.510 --> 06:05.950
I just want to figure out

06:05.950 --> 06:06.630
how to remove

06:06.630 --> 06:07.980
the golden hoop from your neck.

06:09.390 --> 06:10.310
This golden hoop

06:10.790 --> 06:12.470
can't help you with your cultivation,

06:12.550 --> 06:14.230
and it doesn't look good at all.

06:14.710 --> 06:16.150
If you really want a neck ring,

06:16.150 --> 06:17.390
I can make you

06:17.390 --> 06:18.750
a new one that can be

06:18.750 --> 06:19.550
taken off anytime.

06:20.030 --> 06:21.350
I have excellent crafting skills.

06:21.350 --> 06:22.030
I'm sure I can make

06:22.030 --> 06:23.510
a better-looking ring than this.

06:25.470 --> 06:26.380
Is that all you have in mind?

06:27.870 --> 06:29.480
An inch of immortal gold weighs 500 kilograms.

06:29.480 --> 06:30.750
This hoop sits on your neck all day long.

06:30.750 --> 06:31.790
I bet it's tiring you out.

06:31.830 --> 06:32.790
Not long ago,

06:33.190 --> 06:34.909
the friction even hurt your neck.

06:35.270 --> 06:36.740
The sooner I take it off of you,

06:36.909 --> 06:38.470
the less you will suffer.

06:39.070 --> 06:39.870
When it's removed,

06:39.870 --> 06:41.310
you can go wherever you want

06:41.310 --> 06:42.990
instead of being stuck here.

06:43.310 --> 06:44.830
You could've told me this in the beginning.

06:46.230 --> 06:47.070
I wanted to wait

06:47.270 --> 06:49.140
till I found out how to unclasp the hoop,

06:49.470 --> 06:50.830
so I could give you a surprise.

06:53.070 --> 06:54.240
Don't waste your efforts on it.

06:54.630 --> 06:55.430
Why?

06:57.950 --> 06:59.150
Come and tie my hair.

07:18.190 --> 07:19.550
Don't you want a closer look at the golden hoop?

07:20.180 --> 07:21.150
Why not do it now?

07:22.110 --> 07:22.910
May I?

07:41.550 --> 07:42.909
The craftsman who made this golden hoop

07:42.909 --> 07:43.790
must be good.

07:44.110 --> 07:44.940
First, he used

07:44.940 --> 07:46.220
the fold forming technique

07:46.350 --> 07:47.670
to remove as many impurities

07:47.670 --> 07:49.270
in the immortal gold as possible.

07:49.390 --> 07:50.750
Then, he used the cold forging technique

07:50.750 --> 07:52.830
to improve the metal's hardness and ductility.

07:53.300 --> 07:54.670
Each lock piece

07:55.150 --> 07:56.909
has triple usage.

07:57.470 --> 07:58.390
It's part of the lock,

07:58.600 --> 07:59.480
part of the hoop,

08:00.470 --> 08:01.950
and also part of...

08:02.430 --> 08:03.230
A trap!

08:05.030 --> 08:06.310
That's vicious.

08:06.500 --> 08:07.820
If we mess with the wrong lock piece,

08:08.030 --> 08:09.190
the trap will be activated,

08:09.310 --> 08:11.110
leaving no room for error.

08:24.350 --> 08:25.310
The hoop also contains poison.

08:26.350 --> 08:27.430
How insidious.

08:28.430 --> 08:29.870
That lock clasp is of key importance.

08:30.470 --> 08:31.510
The lock works in three ways.

08:31.790 --> 08:32.980
It serves as a trap

08:33.390 --> 08:34.830
that is laid out on the entire golden hoop.

08:35.070 --> 08:36.190
It is also a restraint

08:36.470 --> 08:38.030
that limits your range of motion.

08:39.350 --> 08:40.150
This is odd.

08:41.380 --> 08:43.070
What else is involved?

08:43.510 --> 08:44.310
Magic.

08:45.110 --> 08:46.070
This golden hoop

08:46.310 --> 08:47.470
was made by the top

08:47.470 --> 08:48.950
108 craftsmen of the human race,

08:49.390 --> 08:50.550
together with the nearly one thousand artisans

08:50.550 --> 08:51.550
they led.

08:52.350 --> 08:53.870
It is a combination

08:53.870 --> 08:55.480
of the human race's best craftsmanship

08:55.900 --> 08:56.950
and the immortal race's

08:57.020 --> 08:58.710
most advanced magic of five elements.

08:59.190 --> 09:00.510
So, it takes more than crafting skills

09:00.910 --> 09:02.150
to unclasp the hoop.

09:06.190 --> 09:06.990
You want to quit now?

09:08.430 --> 09:09.910
I will definitely figure out a solution.

09:12.590 --> 09:13.670
Go on to tie my hair.

09:22.150 --> 09:23.270
You're bad at this.

09:23.740 --> 09:24.550
My hair looks terrible.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.790
The real problem lies in your ugly face.

09:28.190 --> 09:28.990
Ji Tanyin,

09:29.550 --> 09:31.030
you'd better be honest.

09:31.910 --> 09:33.830
You are truly a plain-looking man.

09:38.110 --> 09:39.140
The cherries you brought me that day

09:39.140 --> 09:39.950
were delicious.

09:40.590 --> 09:41.390
Do you have any more?

09:41.390 --> 09:42.190
Yes, I do.

09:42.590 --> 09:43.430
Just give me a second.

09:56.230 --> 09:57.030
So soon?

09:57.230 --> 09:58.030
Yeah.

09:58.070 --> 09:59.630
I've washed them for you.

10:22.470 --> 10:23.750
Look at them.

10:24.070 --> 10:25.270
Does it look like they're cursing?

10:25.430 --> 10:26.390
I don't know.

10:27.070 --> 10:28.470
They've been following me

10:28.470 --> 10:29.750
since I left Xiaoxiang Peak.

10:31.640 --> 10:32.430
How come?

10:34.110 --> 10:35.670
You like cherries, don't you?

10:35.950 --> 10:37.630
Several cherry trees on Xiaoxiang Peak

10:37.630 --> 10:38.630
have started bearing fruit lately.

10:38.830 --> 10:40.120
But every day, the cherries that ripen,

10:40.120 --> 10:41.630
turn red and grow big

10:41.630 --> 10:43.430
tend to be pecked by birds.

10:43.600 --> 10:44.560
So, when a new day starts,

10:44.590 --> 10:46.310
I would wait under the trees before dawn

10:46.310 --> 10:47.230
till the cherries ripen

10:47.230 --> 10:48.510
for me to pick them.

10:49.270 --> 10:52.350
But the birds seem a bit angry.

10:53.110 --> 10:54.990
That's why they've been tagging along.

10:57.390 --> 10:58.230
What are you laughing at?

10:58.790 --> 10:59.870
They're cursing at you.

11:00.780 --> 11:01.870
You know what they're saying?

11:02.070 --> 11:02.870
No.

11:03.470 --> 11:04.190
But all the cursing words

11:04.190 --> 11:05.310
in the world

11:05.770 --> 11:06.850
sound similar in tone.

11:21.630 --> 11:22.480
Don't you want some cherries?

11:35.660 --> 11:36.470
Ji Tanyin,

11:37.190 --> 11:38.630
where are you from?

11:38.710 --> 11:39.870
Why did you come to Fangwai Mountain?

11:42.350 --> 11:42.990
Didn't you agree

11:42.990 --> 11:44.300
not to ask that question?

11:44.510 --> 11:45.550
Why are you asking it again?

11:45.990 --> 11:46.910
I'm just taking a shot.

11:47.310 --> 11:48.350
You refused to answer it yesterday.

11:48.590 --> 11:50.110
Maybe you've had a change of mind today.

11:50.510 --> 11:51.590
Things change as time goes by.

11:51.910 --> 11:52.750
Nothing

11:52.750 --> 11:53.870
can remain the same.

11:54.750 --> 11:56.070
I came here for two reasons.

11:56.360 --> 11:57.350
I can only tell you

11:57.990 --> 11:59.230
one of them.

12:00.070 --> 12:00.870
I'm all ears.

12:02.150 --> 12:03.350
I came here to look for someone.

12:03.620 --> 12:04.430
And then?

12:08.030 --> 12:08.950
You should be asking,

12:08.990 --> 12:10.390
"Who are you looking for?"

12:11.990 --> 12:13.670
Well, who are you looking for?

12:16.510 --> 12:17.670
I guess I can call him a friend of mine.

12:18.630 --> 12:19.710
A long time ago,

12:20.110 --> 12:21.310
for some reasons,

12:21.590 --> 12:22.940
I was in agony

12:23.590 --> 12:24.990
and I slept for a long time.

12:25.470 --> 12:26.710
It was he who woke me up.

12:27.910 --> 12:28.950
What happened after that?

12:29.270 --> 12:30.390
I just left.

12:30.780 --> 12:32.470
But we promised each other

12:32.470 --> 12:33.510
that we would meet up again.

12:34.350 --> 12:35.710
However, after that,

12:36.350 --> 12:38.070
he never spoke to me again.

12:38.750 --> 12:39.670
You already left that place.

12:39.950 --> 12:41.150
How was he supposed to talk to you?

12:41.150 --> 12:42.660
He could've transmitted his voice over distances.

12:43.120 --> 12:44.230
Perhaps

12:44.710 --> 12:46.070
your plain looks were

12:46.100 --> 12:47.190
not to his liking,

12:47.190 --> 12:47.990
so he lost

12:47.990 --> 12:49.150
interest in talking to you.

12:49.150 --> 12:50.030
That's not true.

12:50.030 --> 12:51.230
He would never do such a thing.

12:53.310 --> 12:54.830
He must have encountered

12:54.830 --> 12:55.790
some difficulties

12:56.030 --> 12:57.190
and felt hurt.

12:57.870 --> 12:59.990
I bet he was too frustrated and upset

13:00.190 --> 13:01.430
to even have the strength

13:01.430 --> 13:02.310
to talk to people.

13:03.550 --> 13:05.070
But it was really strange.

13:06.630 --> 13:07.390
Why didn't he

13:07.390 --> 13:08.430
turn to me for help?

13:09.230 --> 13:10.390
You're just a mortal.

13:10.430 --> 13:11.470
What help could you possibly offer him?

13:12.910 --> 13:13.790
You wouldn't understand.

13:14.790 --> 13:16.030
But it doesn't matter.

13:16.790 --> 13:17.830
Now that I'm here,

13:18.440 --> 13:19.790
everything will be fine.

13:36.110 --> 13:36.900
Look!

13:37.630 --> 13:39.030
Two flowers have blossomed in the pond.

13:40.030 --> 13:41.390
The wind brought them there.

13:41.590 --> 13:42.990
They're not growing in the pond.

13:43.670 --> 13:44.670
They're so beautiful.

14:22.100 --> 14:23.910
Alright, you stay here.

14:24.030 --> 14:24.910
I'm going back.

14:45.070 --> 14:46.150
But one day,

14:46.870 --> 14:48.670
a voice suddenly came to my ears.

14:49.150 --> 14:50.030
Who are you?

14:51.990 --> 14:52.910
Are you a god?

15:04.720 --> 15:05.830
Only half of the god's image

15:05.830 --> 15:06.630
on this plaque is left.

15:07.630 --> 15:08.910
I don't know who you are,

15:09.120 --> 15:10.590
or the correct way to worship you.

15:12.860 --> 15:13.670
God,

15:14.350 --> 15:15.790
can you hear my voice?

15:17.510 --> 15:18.310
God,

15:18.900 --> 15:20.240
it takes twelve days to walk

15:20.240 --> 15:21.630
from Dayuan to Pingzhou.

15:22.150 --> 15:23.630
My dad and I rode on the Soaring Phoenix

15:23.740 --> 15:24.790
and arrived there in just two days.

15:24.830 --> 15:25.910
Isn't that amazing?

15:31.590 --> 15:32.390
God,

15:33.230 --> 15:34.470
I want to grow up soon,

15:35.270 --> 15:36.830
so I can protect my family.

15:38.310 --> 15:39.110
God,

15:39.310 --> 15:40.480
it is snowing in Fangwai Mountain.

15:40.480 --> 15:41.430
So beautiful.

15:42.190 --> 15:42.990
Would you come

15:42.990 --> 15:44.190
and watch it with me?

15:53.910 --> 15:54.710
Yuanzhong!

15:55.750 --> 15:56.550
What are you doing?

15:57.070 --> 15:58.110
I'm worshiping a god.

15:59.270 --> 16:00.350
As Elder Xinyao said,

16:00.590 --> 16:02.110
one must be earnest when worshiping gods.

16:02.510 --> 16:04.780
If I say prayers a thousand times in my heart,

16:04.190 --> 16:05.740
[Youhu Clan]
[Young Yuanzhong]

16:05.110 --> 16:06.590
a god will show up.

16:07.150 --> 16:07.990
You believe that?

16:07.410 --> 16:08.700
[Youhu Clan]
[Young Tanghua]

16:10.910 --> 16:12.550
If you don't, just leave.

16:19.710 --> 16:20.830
You go on with it then.

16:21.550 --> 16:22.340
I'm leaving.

16:31.670 --> 16:33.110
996.

16:33.380 --> 16:34.790
997.

16:35.550 --> 16:37.230
998.

16:37.990 --> 16:39.630
999.

16:40.510 --> 16:41.320
1,000.

17:13.950 --> 17:14.750
Yuanzhong,

17:15.550 --> 17:16.710
I did visit you

17:16.710 --> 17:17.660
in the form of a god.

17:18.589 --> 17:19.750
Do you remember?

17:25.510 --> 17:26.390
It's time you took medicine.

17:28.860 --> 17:29.870
I'll boil some water.

17:30.470 --> 17:31.310
Where is Ji Tanyin?

17:32.090 --> 17:32.650
I don't know.

17:32.680 --> 17:33.980
I haven't seen her for a few days again.

17:44.670 --> 17:45.470
Magic...

17:46.420 --> 17:47.500
Judging on what you said,

17:47.520 --> 17:49.950
there might be a solution.

17:50.550 --> 17:52.460
There is a kind of magic in the Divine Realm

17:52.460 --> 17:53.910
that allows one to change

17:53.910 --> 17:55.070
one's physical form as one pleases.

17:55.110 --> 17:57.150
Suppose Yuanzhong masters this skill

17:57.180 --> 17:59.000
and shrinks himself,

17:59.000 --> 18:00.630
he can then be free from constraint

18:00.630 --> 18:02.110
and therefore lift

18:02.110 --> 18:03.430
the golden hoop's restrictions.

18:03.550 --> 18:05.300
Who should we learn

18:05.430 --> 18:06.620
this trick from?

18:06.620 --> 18:08.710
It must be Deity Sanxing!

18:09.710 --> 18:10.550
Where is he?

18:10.550 --> 18:12.270
Xuanqing Sea, of course!

18:15.100 --> 18:16.250
Is he in deep slumber?

18:22.110 --> 18:23.830
What about his disciples?

18:24.110 --> 18:25.430
They all perished in the war

18:25.430 --> 18:26.310
between gods and demons.

18:31.950 --> 18:33.750
How could I

18:33.750 --> 18:34.740
forget about this?

18:34.940 --> 18:36.830
The demon clan has a trick,

18:37.190 --> 18:40.480
to which I happen to

18:40.480 --> 18:42.070
know the key.

18:43.390 --> 18:44.670
Please tell me about it, Mr. Loong.

18:57.870 --> 18:59.590
It takes 300 to 500 years of cultivation

18:59.590 --> 19:00.590
to make a small achievement?

19:00.950 --> 19:02.790
That's already considered fast.

19:04.030 --> 19:05.870
But Yuanzhong can't wait that long.

19:06.470 --> 19:07.630
It's true that members of Youhu Clan

19:07.630 --> 19:08.710
have a longer lifespan than humans,

19:08.750 --> 19:10.470
but they can only live 300 to 500 years,

19:10.590 --> 19:12.670
including the time they spend as beasts.

19:12.830 --> 19:14.190
Yuanzhong doesn't have that much time.

19:14.190 --> 19:15.310
He's not young after all.

19:16.350 --> 19:17.310
Is there a trick

19:17.830 --> 19:19.350
that takes less time to learn?

19:19.350 --> 19:20.110
Yes.

19:20.590 --> 19:22.710
The demon clan has a trick

19:22.820 --> 19:24.580
that induces rebirth with a drop of blood.

19:24.630 --> 19:26.670
Reconstructing bones and flesh or growing a new head

19:26.670 --> 19:27.990
is feasible without doubt.

19:27.990 --> 19:29.310
Besides, one can quickly master this trick.

19:30.190 --> 19:32.270
Doesn't it mean one has to finish demonization first?

19:32.270 --> 19:33.590
That's for sure.

19:38.270 --> 19:39.830
Let me think what other options there are...

19:42.870 --> 19:45.260
Lord Taiqing's Eight Diagrams Furnace

19:45.260 --> 19:47.350
is said to be able to melt everything.

19:47.350 --> 19:49.140
Why don't you try melting the gold hoop

19:49.140 --> 19:50.590
with that furnace?

19:52.300 --> 19:54.110
The celestial ladder was destroyed long ago.

19:54.470 --> 19:56.470
How am I supposed to bring Yuanzhong, a living soul,

19:56.470 --> 19:57.510
to the Divine Realm?

19:57.720 --> 19:58.390
And how am I supposed to

19:58.390 --> 20:00.070
keep Yuanzhong safe

20:00.230 --> 20:01.680
when the hoop is melting in the furnace?

20:03.440 --> 20:04.550
Didn't you always

20:04.550 --> 20:07.230
want to make a God Restraining Hoop?

20:07.270 --> 20:08.390
Does this golden hoop

20:08.390 --> 20:10.110
have something in common

20:10.110 --> 20:11.830
with that God Restraining Hoop?

20:12.300 --> 20:13.710
They are different.

20:14.000 --> 20:15.300
None of my ideas work!

20:15.300 --> 20:16.390
You are the God of Craft,

20:16.390 --> 20:17.190
yet you can't think of a solution!

20:17.190 --> 20:18.790
What can I do?

20:18.870 --> 20:20.160
If I were you, I'd rather destroy

20:20.160 --> 20:21.710
the hoop now that it can't be unclasped!

20:26.430 --> 20:27.910
That's worth a try.

20:39.500 --> 20:40.620
Have you noticed

20:40.870 --> 20:42.070
that her being away for a few days

20:42.270 --> 20:42.950
does not affect us

20:42.950 --> 20:43.990
in any way?

20:44.070 --> 20:45.190
Yeah, exactly.

20:45.630 --> 20:46.430
I still have to do all the cooking,

20:46.430 --> 20:47.190
boil water,

20:47.190 --> 20:48.190
and sweep fallen leaves as usual.

20:50.590 --> 20:52.140
The period for spirit refinement already passed.

20:52.350 --> 20:53.790
Why hasn't Tianqu Peak taken any action yet?

20:54.470 --> 20:55.270
I don't know.

20:55.830 --> 20:56.590
Anyway, the reason can't be

20:56.590 --> 20:57.680
that they are concerned about your health.

20:59.830 --> 21:00.630
Never mind.

21:01.200 --> 21:02.110
I can go meet him,

21:02.710 --> 21:03.820
even though he didn't ask me to.

21:54.190 --> 21:55.830
How many days are left until Dingxu's birthday?

21:55.950 --> 21:57.550
Five. I'm keeping count.

21:57.950 --> 21:59.150
That old man tells those

21:59.150 --> 22:00.310
close to him

22:00.310 --> 22:01.910
that his birthday is on June 17th,

22:01.910 --> 22:02.920
but that's not true.

22:03.190 --> 22:04.790
He was actually born in spring.

22:05.230 --> 22:06.020
Wait!

22:10.710 --> 22:11.870
Why are you following me again?

22:11.950 --> 22:13.700
I certainly have to stick with you when you go out.

22:13.920 --> 22:15.310
I have promised to do so!

22:19.430 --> 22:20.910
Are you going to Tianqu Peak again?

22:23.030 --> 22:24.570
Didn't I tell you not to?

22:26.110 --> 22:27.270
You're just a maid.

22:27.590 --> 22:29.070
Why should I listen to you?

22:31.200 --> 22:31.990
You can't go there!

22:34.030 --> 22:34.830
Ji Tanyin,

22:35.110 --> 22:36.830
you'd better be clear about who you are

22:36.900 --> 22:38.030
and what your job is.

22:39.350 --> 22:41.300
My job is to protect you

22:41.300 --> 22:42.350
and take good care of you.

22:42.460 --> 22:44.110
If I turn a blind eye and do nothing

22:44.110 --> 22:45.110
when I know clearly

22:45.110 --> 22:46.110
that they're trying to hurt you,

22:46.230 --> 22:47.870
I will be scourged by my conscience!

22:49.830 --> 22:51.150
In my opinion,

22:51.310 --> 22:52.710
Dingxu didn't ask to meet you anyway.

22:52.710 --> 22:54.030
You don't have to go.

23:01.670 --> 23:03.070
Didn't you hear what he said?

23:03.070 --> 23:04.200
I'm already out.

23:04.200 --> 23:05.150
Might as well take a walk.

23:36.750 --> 23:37.550
Somebody get in here!

23:41.470 --> 23:42.270
Grand Elder.

23:43.270 --> 23:45.240
Tell Baili Xiang and Tanghua

23:45.240 --> 23:46.470
to rally troops in the War Division.

23:47.510 --> 23:48.510
What happened?

23:49.470 --> 23:51.030
Yuanzhong has left the mountain.

24:01.510 --> 24:02.960
It tastes sour!

24:03.270 --> 24:04.110
Yuanzhong once said

24:04.110 --> 24:05.630
only the fruit that has been exposed to sufficient sunlight

24:05.630 --> 24:06.630
tastes sweet.

24:19.470 --> 24:20.620
Yuanzhong, hurry up!

24:21.470 --> 24:22.710
This is the wild fruit I found.

24:22.710 --> 24:23.150
It's delicious.

24:23.150 --> 24:23.550
Really?

24:23.550 --> 24:24.750
You're the first one I thought of.

24:24.750 --> 24:25.470
Try it now.

24:30.950 --> 24:31.750
It tastes good!

24:42.030 --> 24:42.870
What's wrong?

24:43.860 --> 24:44.670
Nothing.

24:46.990 --> 24:47.870
Let me see.

24:47.890 --> 24:48.880
I said I'm fine.

24:48.910 --> 24:49.790
Just let me take a look!

24:54.270 --> 24:55.830
They have cast the restraint on you.

24:57.030 --> 24:57.590
But we haven't

24:57.590 --> 24:58.990
even gone far, have we?

25:00.230 --> 25:01.390
How could they do this?

25:01.830 --> 25:02.630
Aren't we still

25:02.630 --> 25:03.950
within Youhu Clan's territory?

25:04.190 --> 25:05.100
If we go a bit farther from here,

25:05.710 --> 25:07.070
We'll be out of Youhu Clan's territory.

25:08.070 --> 25:08.870
But we don't mean

25:08.870 --> 25:09.960
to go far away.

25:10.750 --> 25:11.870
They don't know that.

25:14.950 --> 25:15.790
It's actually nice.

25:16.470 --> 25:17.550
It has been decades

25:17.710 --> 25:18.910
since I last came here.

25:20.750 --> 25:22.550
Wait. I've brought some medicine.

25:24.350 --> 25:25.190
It won't work.

25:25.390 --> 25:26.670
They're hurting me with magic.

25:26.830 --> 25:28.310
Ordinary medicine is of no help.

25:29.350 --> 25:30.390
Turn your head.

25:34.750 --> 25:36.110
I already told you it wouldn't work.

25:38.910 --> 25:40.000
Does it hurt?

25:40.440 --> 25:41.550
Of course it does.

25:45.610 --> 25:47.050
You'll feel better when I apply medicine on you.

25:47.190 --> 25:49.030
It'll work like a charm.

25:51.670 --> 25:52.950
When I was bitten by a snake,

25:53.270 --> 25:54.830
this is the medicine you applied on me, right?

25:55.430 --> 25:56.230
What?

25:56.720 --> 25:58.070
Can this medicine fix anything?

25:58.710 --> 25:59.910
You're such a chatterbox.

26:00.470 --> 26:01.270
Tilt your head back.

26:16.750 --> 26:17.550
Ji Tanyin.

26:19.720 --> 26:20.990
Why are you so kind to me?

26:21.550 --> 26:23.190
Because I am your handmaiden.

26:23.190 --> 26:23.910
That's not it.

26:25.390 --> 26:26.470
You have done

26:26.950 --> 26:28.270
more for me than a handmaiden

26:28.270 --> 26:29.430
is obligated to.

26:31.350 --> 26:32.150
Why?

26:32.710 --> 26:33.990
You're asking too many questions.

26:35.190 --> 26:36.000
Answer me.

26:40.400 --> 26:41.110
Because now

26:41.110 --> 26:42.300
in this world,

26:42.300 --> 26:43.590
I have only one mission.

26:43.670 --> 26:44.950
And that is to be with you,

26:45.590 --> 26:47.110
till your hair turns gray,

26:47.270 --> 26:48.350
your teeth all fall out,

26:48.630 --> 26:50.110
and you die of old age.

26:51.300 --> 26:52.830
Your life will end one day.

26:53.110 --> 26:54.480
I just want you to spend it happily.

26:54.670 --> 26:56.020
You want me to spend my life happily?

26:56.270 --> 26:57.070
Yes.

26:57.470 --> 26:58.830
I always keep my promises.

26:59.880 --> 27:01.310
That's a blessing I extend to you.

27:16.750 --> 27:17.590
High Priest!

27:27.160 --> 27:28.310
What beautiful scenery.

27:28.310 --> 27:30.590
You must be in a good mood.

27:30.870 --> 27:31.870
I'm just taking a stroll.

27:32.590 --> 27:33.830
What are you doing here?

27:34.550 --> 27:36.510
There is a spreading panic in the clan lately.

27:36.750 --> 27:37.550
We are concerned

27:37.550 --> 27:38.940
about your safety.

27:39.270 --> 27:40.150
I'm doing great.

27:40.470 --> 27:41.950
Thank you all for your concern.

27:42.470 --> 27:43.440
High Priest,

27:43.910 --> 27:45.640
why would you suddenly come to this place?

27:47.310 --> 27:48.430
I wouldn't say "suddenly."

27:49.070 --> 27:49.910
When I was young,

27:50.110 --> 27:51.430
I often played here.

27:51.550 --> 27:52.270
I especially liked

27:52.270 --> 27:53.590
the prickly fruit growing there.

27:54.270 --> 27:55.510
But since I became an adult,

27:55.830 --> 27:56.990
I've been bothered by all sorts of affairs,

27:56.990 --> 27:58.630
and never had a chance to come here again.

27:59.550 --> 28:00.390
Recently, I have frequently

28:00.390 --> 28:01.470
dreamed about this place.

28:01.580 --> 28:02.870
So I thought I should come by.

28:03.550 --> 28:04.590
Does that count as

28:04.830 --> 28:06.710
an obsession of yours?

28:08.670 --> 28:09.670
I guess it does.

28:10.230 --> 28:11.390
I have such an obsession,

28:11.670 --> 28:13.830
and it is affecting what I say and do.

28:14.470 --> 28:15.430
It shows that my cultivation

28:15.430 --> 28:16.630
is far from perfection.

28:17.270 --> 28:18.510
I should go to Tianqu Peak more often

28:18.510 --> 28:19.640
to strengthen my willpower.

28:20.390 --> 28:21.820
However, after days of waiting,

28:22.310 --> 28:22.990
I still didn't

28:22.990 --> 28:24.480
hear from Elder Dingxu.

28:25.910 --> 28:26.870
It was my fault.

28:27.310 --> 28:29.190
I was worried about your health,

28:29.740 --> 28:30.590
but I didn't realize

28:30.750 --> 28:32.870
I was holding you back from your cultivation.

28:36.550 --> 28:37.340
It's alright.

28:38.240 --> 28:39.470
I can make up for it when I'm back.

28:40.790 --> 28:43.750
Can we go back now?

28:44.710 --> 28:45.510
Sure. Let's go.

28:45.750 --> 28:47.150
After you, High Priest.

28:53.950 --> 28:54.750
Sir,

28:54.990 --> 28:55.820
what's going on?

28:58.390 --> 28:59.180
Tanghua!

29:00.110 --> 29:00.910
Sir...

29:01.430 --> 29:02.830
It's the possessing technique!

29:04.910 --> 29:05.710
The possessing technique?

29:08.470 --> 29:09.270
Sir!

29:12.310 --> 29:15.270
Die, all of you!

29:16.590 --> 29:17.400
Watch out!

29:27.350 --> 29:28.790
Sir, wake up!

29:36.030 --> 29:36.830
Yuanzhong,

29:37.910 --> 29:40.230
I must kill you to honor our dead warriors!

29:40.230 --> 29:40.990
Sir!

29:41.260 --> 29:42.070
This is bad!

29:42.270 --> 29:43.150
He is going to explode!

29:46.540 --> 29:47.350
Sir!

29:47.470 --> 29:48.270
Wake up!

29:58.830 --> 29:59.630
Sir.

30:02.510 --> 30:03.310
Sir!

30:05.670 --> 30:06.480
Sir?

30:07.150 --> 30:07.950
Sir.

30:17.630 --> 30:19.830
Those from Tianqu Peak have come and checked several times.

30:19.910 --> 30:21.070
Fortunately, the Essence Nourishing Pill

30:21.110 --> 30:22.430
was sent away long ago.

30:22.950 --> 30:23.750
Young Mistress Dai,

30:24.470 --> 30:25.910
will you leave with us?

30:32.250 --> 30:33.130
That's great!

30:33.350 --> 30:34.640
When the old City Lord sees you,

30:34.710 --> 30:36.150
he will be thrilled.

30:39.480 --> 30:40.270
Sir.

30:40.430 --> 30:41.390
What's the rush?

30:41.870 --> 30:43.880
Word has it that Mr. Tanghua

30:43.880 --> 30:45.230
was harmed by the War Demons' possessing technique,

30:45.230 --> 30:46.500
and is now confined in Jinxia Palace.

30:46.830 --> 30:47.630
Who was harmed?

30:48.480 --> 30:50.240
Mr. Tanghua from the War Division.

30:52.270 --> 30:53.070
Young Mistress Dai...

30:54.150 --> 30:55.030
You guys leave first.

30:55.030 --> 30:56.740
I'll go back when this matter is settled.

31:08.830 --> 31:10.750
Tie him up with a magic rope now!

31:11.990 --> 31:13.150
The magic rope on the floor!

31:13.270 --> 31:14.070
Hurry!

31:17.270 --> 31:17.990
This?

31:17.990 --> 31:19.070
Throw it now!

31:35.970 --> 31:37.180
Tidy up the place.

32:16.230 --> 32:17.400
You may leave now.

32:19.390 --> 32:20.270
Are you hungry?

32:21.060 --> 32:23.380
Do you need water and food?

32:29.250 --> 32:30.660
Sir, get some rest.

32:30.910 --> 32:31.910
I'll take my leave now.

32:44.750 --> 32:46.190
I've been on this mountain for ten years.

32:46.830 --> 32:48.590
I have meet you many times.

32:50.060 --> 32:51.590
I just wanted to check on you,

32:51.590 --> 32:52.670
and that was it.

32:53.250 --> 32:54.060
Now,

32:55.110 --> 32:56.150
I've got what I wanted.

32:56.930 --> 32:58.090
What are you trying to say?

33:09.880 --> 33:10.830
My name is Zhi Dai.

33:14.310 --> 33:15.340
Mr. Tanghua,

33:15.750 --> 33:16.550
goodbye.

33:23.440 --> 33:29.520
[Jinxia Palace]

33:35.410 --> 33:38.180
[Liujiao Palace]

33:49.550 --> 33:50.480
It's snowing.

33:53.710 --> 33:54.710
You keep walking.

33:55.430 --> 33:56.590
I want some time alone.

34:14.310 --> 34:16.190
I was indeed afflicted by the War Demons' possessing technique.

34:17.230 --> 34:18.030
Everyone,

34:18.889 --> 34:20.489
the War Demons have returned.

34:20.750 --> 34:21.840
How is it possible?

34:22.070 --> 34:23.030
Didn't the War Demons all die

34:23.030 --> 34:24.750
in Pinghu years ago?

34:24.989 --> 34:26.219
What should we do

34:26.219 --> 34:27.630
if the War Demons attack us?

34:29.030 --> 34:30.620
Who could resist the War Demons?

34:30.620 --> 34:31.429
Yeah!

34:31.630 --> 34:32.590
If that's true,

34:32.590 --> 34:33.469
what can we do?

34:33.469 --> 34:34.790
I told you that was the War Demons' sorcery,

34:34.870 --> 34:35.989
yet none of you believed me!

34:36.150 --> 34:37.030
How about now?

34:37.389 --> 34:38.190
Yeah.

34:38.610 --> 34:39.969
Who can fight the War Demons off?

34:40.630 --> 34:41.469
Quiet down.

34:42.870 --> 34:43.840
Elder Xinyao,

34:44.280 --> 34:45.380
what's your opinion?

34:45.949 --> 34:47.510
The symptoms do look

34:48.310 --> 34:50.270
a lot like those of the possessing technique.

34:50.710 --> 34:51.750
Then what are we waiting for?

34:52.510 --> 34:53.750
We should turn to the High Priest for help!

34:53.790 --> 34:55.350
As long as he is around,

34:55.510 --> 34:56.630
the War Demons won't be able

34:56.630 --> 34:57.510
to stir up trouble.

34:57.580 --> 34:58.550
The High Priest

34:58.550 --> 35:00.630
managed to wipe out their whole clan years ago.

35:01.150 --> 35:03.320
We'll let him do it again if necessary!

35:03.710 --> 35:05.500
Yeah, he can do it again!

35:06.200 --> 35:07.750
This is a serious issue.

35:08.110 --> 35:09.990
We must think it through and devise a plan.

35:10.360 --> 35:12.510
Discuss any other matter you want but not this one.

35:12.670 --> 35:14.140
No matter how you deliberate on it,

35:14.140 --> 35:15.590
the outcome will be the same.

35:16.270 --> 35:17.270
Except the High Priest,

35:17.270 --> 35:17.910
none of us

35:17.910 --> 35:19.140
can fight the War Demons off.

35:19.170 --> 35:21.490
Moreover, we must act quickly

35:21.590 --> 35:23.470
before we miss out on the best opportunity!

35:24.510 --> 35:25.350
Baili Xiang,

35:25.790 --> 35:26.590
Lv Chengshi,

35:27.270 --> 35:28.590
say something!

35:30.190 --> 35:32.630
I think you've made a good point.

35:37.430 --> 35:38.390
Elder Xinyao,

35:39.190 --> 35:40.270
what do you think?

35:40.750 --> 35:41.580
Grand Elder,

35:42.510 --> 35:43.510
I also think

35:43.870 --> 35:45.950
we should lift up the seal

35:46.590 --> 35:47.350
on the High Priest.

35:47.810 --> 35:48.730
What seal?

35:49.070 --> 35:50.710
The golden hoop on the High Priest's neck.

35:50.990 --> 35:52.750
Didn't the High Priest seal himself

35:52.750 --> 35:53.830
with the golden hoop

35:53.830 --> 35:54.990
to prove his determination to become a god?

35:56.270 --> 35:57.060
-Yes!
-Yes!
-Yes!

35:57.510 --> 35:58.310
Fine.

35:59.630 --> 36:01.060
Let's invite the High Priest

36:01.630 --> 36:02.910
to join us in the discussion.

36:20.350 --> 36:22.020
Still reading?

36:22.870 --> 36:24.710
You are the God of Craft.

36:24.740 --> 36:27.210
No one can compare to you

36:27.270 --> 36:28.670
in terms of craftsmanship.

36:28.750 --> 36:30.470
If even you can't unclasp this lock,

36:30.470 --> 36:32.830
then no one else can.

36:33.270 --> 36:34.380
I do have a way to solve the problem,

36:34.510 --> 36:35.790
but the current conditions don't allow me to.

36:36.230 --> 36:37.910
If I am to wreck the golden hoop,

36:37.910 --> 36:39.310
I need to make a new tool.

36:39.590 --> 36:40.910
However, ordinary flames

36:40.910 --> 36:42.100
can't help me form

36:42.100 --> 36:43.550
something as hard as the hoop.

36:44.390 --> 36:45.590
If I recklessly use divine power

36:46.190 --> 36:47.400
in the mortal realm,

36:47.950 --> 36:49.140
I'll suffer a backlash.

36:51.360 --> 36:53.700
The formation on that golden hoop

36:53.700 --> 36:55.590
is called Immortal Binding Lock.

36:55.590 --> 36:56.150
Would it

36:56.150 --> 36:58.070
have something in common

36:58.070 --> 36:59.110
with Ju Liusun's Immortal Binding Rope?

36:59.110 --> 37:00.070
Maybe they can restrain immortals,

37:00.070 --> 37:01.270
but not gods.

37:02.630 --> 37:04.030
If Yuanzhong becomes a god,

37:04.830 --> 37:06.390
he will break free from restrictions.

37:08.110 --> 37:09.710
You don't get what I mean.

37:10.590 --> 37:11.870
Have you considered

37:11.870 --> 37:13.480
giving him some divine energy

37:13.480 --> 37:15.540
so he can temporarily pass off as a god

37:15.540 --> 37:16.950
and deceive the golden hoop?

37:18.540 --> 37:19.530
Can I do that?

37:19.620 --> 37:20.910
Of course you can!

37:20.990 --> 37:21.870
Don't you remember?

37:21.870 --> 37:23.750
In the war between gods and demons,

37:23.750 --> 37:25.470
Ju Liusun's Immortal Binding Rope

37:25.470 --> 37:26.590
was completely useless

37:26.590 --> 37:27.590
because those on the battlefield

37:27.590 --> 37:28.550
were either gods or demons,

37:28.550 --> 37:30.030
without a single immortal.

37:31.020 --> 37:33.430
The Immortal Binding Rope can't restrain a god.

37:33.460 --> 37:35.510
Neither can the Immortal Binding Lock.

37:36.590 --> 37:39.190
But whether he will let you

37:39.220 --> 37:41.100
give him divine energy remains a question.

37:41.230 --> 37:42.710
Will it reveal the truth

37:42.710 --> 37:44.230
that you're a god if you do so?

37:44.590 --> 37:45.390
No, it won't.

37:46.650 --> 37:48.510
Deity Shiyi once gave me

37:48.510 --> 37:49.790
some sand from Heng River.

37:50.070 --> 37:51.630
It can freeze time.

37:53.470 --> 37:55.150
Right. I'm going to use that.

38:30.620 --> 38:33.350
You're defending the High Priest of Youhu Clan,

38:33.510 --> 38:34.750
making vows with your spiritual heart,

38:34.750 --> 38:36.190
and risking your own life.

38:36.270 --> 38:37.590
Is it only because

38:37.590 --> 38:38.790
he is a good person?

38:43.060 --> 38:43.620
Yes.

38:47.030 --> 38:47.950
By the way, Mr. Loong,

38:48.190 --> 38:49.430
do you remember

38:49.610 --> 38:50.750
I told you years ago

38:50.750 --> 38:52.870
that I had a believer in the mortal realm?

38:54.630 --> 38:55.670
I do remember.

38:58.830 --> 38:59.740
Do you mean...

39:37.350 --> 39:38.580
I've found him.

40:03.980 --> 40:05.900
Y-You're a god?

40:22.700 --> 40:23.670
You're really a god?

40:24.870 --> 40:26.430
Gods do exist!

40:27.350 --> 40:28.270
You're real!

40:29.630 --> 40:30.430
God,

40:31.060 --> 40:32.270
I'm a believer of yours.

40:32.670 --> 40:33.390
Can you make a wish

40:33.390 --> 40:34.630
of mine come true?

40:34.630 --> 40:35.920
What is your wish?

40:36.750 --> 40:38.270
Can you kill all the War Demons?

40:38.750 --> 40:40.150
They've been bullying us,

40:40.460 --> 40:42.050
and they've killed many of our people!

40:42.390 --> 40:43.910
I'm not the God of War.

40:44.430 --> 40:45.670
I can't interfere with

40:45.670 --> 40:46.750
the mortals' conflicts.

40:47.270 --> 40:49.390
I can't make that wish of yours come true.

40:49.830 --> 40:50.630
Well...

40:51.340 --> 40:52.550
Can you save lives?

40:53.030 --> 40:54.070
I have a good friend

40:54.190 --> 40:55.110
whose name is Tanghua.

40:55.280 --> 40:55.910
His parents

40:55.910 --> 40:57.310
were killed by the War Demons.

40:57.480 --> 40:58.670
He has been left alone.

40:58.800 --> 40:59.660
I pity him.

41:00.270 --> 41:01.750
Can you revive his parents?

41:02.230 --> 41:03.670
The dead cannot be brought back to life.

41:04.330 --> 41:05.530
I can't help you with that.

41:07.550 --> 41:08.070
Then I...

41:08.070 --> 41:09.430
Take your time with the thinking.

41:09.750 --> 41:10.800
You have my promise.

41:11.350 --> 41:12.790
I will make one of your wishes come true.

41:13.230 --> 41:15.350
As long as it is moral and righteous,

41:15.550 --> 41:17.070
I will make it come true.

41:17.550 --> 41:19.550
Will I see you again?

41:19.790 --> 41:20.480
Didn't you tell me

41:20.480 --> 41:22.270
Fangwai Mountain looked beautiful when it snowed?

41:23.270 --> 41:24.630
When it snows again,

41:24.820 --> 41:26.430
take out the jade token and make a wish.

41:26.550 --> 41:27.830
Then I will come meet you.

41:28.020 --> 41:29.140
I got it, God.

41:29.590 --> 41:31.920
I'll see you at that time!

41:33.190 --> 41:34.230
I'll see you at that time.
